  "primary": "A projectile flies in an arc where you look and strikes the first target. Effects:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire + 1.25 ❤ earth + 1.25 ❤ arcane (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Light push\n• Breaks up to 3 blocks within 0.5 blocks (twice as many if brittle)\n• Heals 1 ❤\n• Regeneration: +0.5 ❤ every 2 s for 6 s\n• Growth: up to 2 nearby blocks — crops +2 stages, dirt turns to grass, roots grow upward\n• Arcane instability: −0.25 ❤ every 2 s for 4.5 s\n• Rooted in place for 3 s\n• Revives the nearest fallen player or creature within 3.6 blocks with 30% health\n• Puts out fire",
